          "description": "Pizza, anybody? The BrainBots are out of the classroom and shrinking all the way down to learn as much as they can about the organs that process our food - the digestive system.\n\nJoin Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs as they follow a piece of food from the mouth through the process of digestion, right through to it leaving the body. Warning - this one contains poop!"
